<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 24.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 24.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 24	Feb 21     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  262.420     264.250     247.020    6.23 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.710     303.950     306.830   -1.02 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.660     156.640     158.970   -1.45 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.398	46.380	47.182   -1.66 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  427.300     427.960     419.180    1.94 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.370     139.460     141.685   -1.63 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.806	15.846	16.185   -2.34 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.580     215.200     212.430    1.01 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.852	 1.853	 1.888   -1.91 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.560	 1.561	 1.581   -1.33 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  179.845     179.200     183.135   -1.80 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
